  data: {
    LLM: "If you have a strong suit but lack the top card (the Ace), bid high (8 or 9) and call the Ace of that suit to guarantee a powerful partner.\n\nThe Discard: When using the kitty, discard cards from a suit you are 'short' in. This allows you to trump into that suit early in the game.\n\nDefensive play for opponents: If you suspect a partner has been called, try to 'bleed' the bidder's trumps early to prevent them from cross-ruffing.",
    Player: "If you have a strong suit but lack the top card (the Ace), bid high (8 or 9) and call the Ace of that suit to guarantee a powerful partner.\n\nThe Discard: When using the kitty, discard cards from a suit you are 'short' in. This allows you to trump into that suit early in the game.\n\nDefensive play for opponents: If you suspect a partner has been called, try to 'bleed' the bidder's trumps early to prevent them from cross-ruffing.",
